Package: tenebra-zbra
Version: 0.1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TenebraOS Team
Depends: tar, xz-utils
Description: TenebraOS package manager (native C)
 Zebra (zbra) is TenebraOS's package manager, implemented in C11 against
 the libc ABI alone so that it can be built and shipped in any image,
 including the recovery environment that would have to repair it.
 .
 Payload handling is delegated to the tools that already do those jobs
 correctly: tar and xz for the native archive format, dpkg-deb for Debian
 packages, and the owning tool for RPM, AUR and snap.
 .
 This package replaces the earlier Bash implementation of the same tool.
